        "original_id": "e9862b21-faa2-57af-85ae-982b9a35dc94",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Rolls-Royce Holdings plc, Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc., Rolls-Royce\n- Products: AWJ-21\n- Concepts: underwater discharge water jet propulsion, propulsive efficiency, acoustic signature, maneuverability\n- Topics: Sea Jet, Destroyer Class combatants\n\nFacts:\n- Rolls-Royce was established in 1904 and today designs, manufactures, and distributes power systems for aviation and other industries.\n- Rolls-Royce Holdings plc was incorporated in February 2011 as a British multinational public limited company that owns Rolls-Royce.\n- Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc. developed the AWJ-21 underwater discharge water jet as a propulsion concept.\n- Sea Jet tested the AWJ-21 among its first technologies.\n- The AWJ-21 was intended to provide increased propulsive efficiency, reduced acoustic signature, and improved maneuverability compared with previous Destroyer Class combatants.",
